seg-c2e215edd86c = Do not add a transmit path, a transmit dependency or a transmit example to the open engine.

# text
seg-452b44a9ca8a = Do not add a waveform generator whose output is a jamming or spoofing signal meant for playback.

# text
seg-4df4d15a5f1c = New hardware inputs are read-only by default; a write needs an explicit flag and a line in this file.

